Note on third-party components:

Stemscribe does not bundle or redistribute third-party neural network model
weights. Model files are downloaded at the user's request from their official
upstream sources, and each model's own license applies. Engine binaries
(whisper.cpp, FFmpeg, Python-based separators) are installed at runtime from
their official distributions and remain under their respective licenses.
See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md (added with the first runtime integration) and
docs/MODEL-REGISTRY.md for details.
